('More front aero','More front lateral capacity at speed; usually less high-speed understeer.','Fast corners','More aerodynamic load at the front shifts the available axle force balance.','Less front aero usually shifts balance toward high-speed understeer.','Tire load sensitivity, drag, and the complete aero map still matter.'),
